ceived\nBill Type\nCash\nDue Date\nAdditional invoice details\nProduct matching and catalogue details\nProduct matching and details\nMatch each invoice line to the correct saved product and pack before adding stock. Manufacturer is optional.\nRefresh Matches\n\nLine 1: Moisture Cream\n\nNot in inventory\nCorrect invoice name\n\nOCR / DRAFT LINE\n\nProduct\nMoisture Cream\nManufacturer\nSample maker\nPack\n50 g\nMRP\n₹200.00\nRate\n₹120.00\nBatch\nB-102\n\nSAVED PRODUCT\n\nProduct\nMoisture Cream\nManufacturer\nSample maker\nPack\n50 g\nMRP\n₹200.00\nProduct kind\nCOSMETIC\nPrescription required\nNo\nComposition\n-\nStrength\n-\nInvoice product kind\nNot recorded\nMedicine\nCosmetic / skin care\nOther consumable\nCheck or correct saved product details\n\nNew product details\n\nChoose the product kind after checking its label or saved catalog. Enter known details only. Invoice pack size is not medicine strength.\n\nProduct kind\nChoose product kind\nMedicine\nCosmetic / skin care\nOther consumable\n\nChoose a product kind to continue.\n\nCreate new item\nSearch saved products manually\nProducts on this bill\nAdd Line\nApply GST or discount to selected rows\n1. Moisture Cream\nB-102 · 10 paid + 2 free\n1 check\n₹1,416.00\nProduct\nPack Size\nStock unit\nBatch\nNeeds checking\nExp. Month\nExp. Year\nPaid Qty\nFree Qty\nRate\nMRP\nDisc %\nCGST %\nSGST %\nIGST %\nOther commercial details\nCheck bill total\nReported discounts, TCS & rounding\n\nGross\n\n₹1,200.00\n\nTaxable\n\n₹1,200.00\n\nGST\n\n₹216.00\n\nTCS\n\n₹0.00\n\nNet Payable\n\n₹1,416.00\n\nLines\n\n1\n\nPaid stock units\n\n10\n\nFree stock units\n\n2\n\nReceived stock units\n\n12\n\nIndicative margin at MRP\n\n41.00%\n\nQuantities count each line’s declared stock units, including free units, without multiplying by pack contents. Margin is a percentage of sales at each unit’s MRP before selling discounts: GST is excluded from sales and purchase cost; TCS and rounding are excluded. Missing MRP makes margin unknown